Error [E0954]: write `comptime NAME = ...`, not `comptime val NAME = ...`
  --> tests/ui/comptime_val_keyword.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | comptime val X = 5;
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `comptime` is already the binding keyword, and a comptime value is always a constant
 Fix: remove the extra keyword: `comptime NAME = ...`
